      "content": "converge 零件湊齊；concurrent 同時開工。conspicuous 裝到超顯眼；consolidate 焊成一塊。concoct 調配配方；condone 默許劣件過關；concord 和諧出廠——廠長：converge on standards；never condone silent forks。"
